@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered
Unregistered --> Registered : Signup
Registered --> EmailVerificationPending : Register
EmailVerificationPending --> Verified : Email Verified
EmailVerificationPending --> Registered : Resend Verification
Verified --> LoggedIn : Login
LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : Logout
LoggedIn --> Suspended : Suspended by Admin
Suspended --> LoggedOut : Logout
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : Login
Verified --> PasswordResetRequested : Forgot Password
PasswordResetRequested --> Verified : Password Reset Success
@enduml
